// Level 3: The Cold Store (working name), a refrigerated depot gone dark.
// World frame: metres, x east, z south (north is −Z), y up. A concrete panel fence encloses x −50…50, z −40…40; you come
// in at the gate in the south side, the breach in the east side or the hole in the west side.
// Most of the fighting is inside the cold store (x −40…16, z −36…0), whose floor is 1.2 m up: two lorry trailers stand
// backed onto its second and third dock doors, tunnels up from the yard; the first has a ramp; the fourth is a drop.
// Outside: the lorry park, the plant room and the ammonia tanks in their compound (north-east), the depot office
// (south-east), the gatehouse and the weighbridge (south-west).
// Fence segments: 0 north (x −50→50, at_m = x + 50), 1 east (z −40→40, at_m = z + 40),
// 2 south (x 50→−50, at_m = 50 − x), 3 west (z 40→−40, at_m = 40 − z).
// The cold store's local frame is world + (40, 0, 36): its dock face is at world z 0.
{
  "id": "cold_store",
  "displayName": "The Cold Store",
  "description": "A refrigerated depot gone dark: chambers of racking off a long aisle behind heavy doors, a dock hall a lorry's height above the yard with trailers backed onto it that you can run through, and a plant room of dead compressors.",
